# Not part of the page. tools/ holds check_shaders.py (the repo-side check that
# the demo's copies are still the plugin's), build-wasm.sh and the crosscheck
# against the plugin's harness; wasm/ holds the page's host glue and GL shim,
# which are compiled INTO jackpot-core.wasm, and the build's input manifest.
# wrangler would otherwise upload them and serve them, which is neither useful
# nor anybody's business.
tools/
